==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*seh₂g-}}
From {{bor|en|grc|ἡγεμών||a leader, guide, commander, chief}}, from {{m|grc|ἡγέομαι||to lead}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|US}} {{IPA|en|/ˈhɛ.d͡ʒɛ.mən/}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# A dominating leader or force, especially that which dominates a separate political entity; a [[hegemonist]].

====Related terms====
